      "date": "2026-01-24T20:38:48.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.14 (vs ₹0.42 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.14 (up from ₹0.42 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹6.03m (up 29% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹2.21m (up ₹8.78m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 37% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was primarily driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 37% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 28% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
