      "date": "2026-01-23T10:17:00.000Z",
      "title": "Libord Finance Limited Appoints Mohini Devanand Bhavsar as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 23, 2026",
      "body": "Libord Finance Limited has appointed Ms. Mohini Devanand Bhavsar  as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with effect from January 23, 2026 pursuant to Section 203 of the Companies Act, 2013 and Regulation 6(1) of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. Ms. Mohini Devanand Bhavsar is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (Membership No. 79405) having rich experience in corporate laws and compliances.",
